---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import { Backlight } from "$lib/components/magic/backlight";
---

<section class="m-20" id="about">
  <h1 class="font-mono text-5xl">
    &gt; About Nido<Backlight class="text-emerald-400 inline-block"
      >CC</Backlight
    >
  </h1>
  <div class="mt-8 flex justify-between space-x-12">
    <p class="w-[70ch] text-xl">
      The Nido Coding Club has been here for countless years. From being Girls
      who Code, to just a general coding club for everybody to join - the Nido
      Coding Club has gone through many changes and leaders today.<br /><br /> This
      2026-2027 school year, however, things will be different once again. Instead
      of being a club solely catered to those who already know how to code, we will
      assist everyone and anyone (even with zero experience) in the journey to learn
      coding, as it remains one of the most in-demand skills today despite the overwhelming
      presence of AI.<br /><br />Our end of school year project will be a
      website or app, or any real life technological solution to a problem that
      will put our skills to use (goal subject to change). We will also be
      offering to create and design tools and websites for other clubs upon
      request! :)
    </p>
    <Image
      src="/images/group-picture.jpg"
      alt="Coding Club group picture!"
      height={400}
      width={600}
    />
  </div>
</section>
